# refund-webhooks

Receives Paygate refund webhooks and exposes a small internal refunds API used by the
payments ops console and finance analytics.

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `src/server.ts` | HTTP routes (`npm start`, `PORT`, `DATA_DIR`, `CONFIG_DIR`) |
